     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">That&#39;s really weird. Maybe you have some strange non-visible characters on that line or the surrounding ones? I&#39;ve seen that happen before when code is cut and pasted. I&#39;d try deleting the first three lines, and then typing them in manually.<div><br></div><div>If that doesn&#39;t fix it, you can send me the code directly and I&#39;ll see if I can find the problem.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
